WEBVTT

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:34.570
They say the grass is always
greener on the other side.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:38.850
It's true that we tend to
desire the things we don't have.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.490
Bushy-Brows?

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.390
You're so lucky, Naruto...

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.500
You can use ninjutsu.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.980
Where'd that come from?

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.460
Well!

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:55.840
<i>Somebody help!</i>

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.860
<i>Purse snatcher!</i>

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.340
<i>I'll take this!</i>

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.910
<i>Not on my watch!</i>

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.260
<i>Nice work, Guy Sensei.</i>

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.470
<i>That was fantastic.</i>

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.290
<i>But you shouldn't have 
thrown your poor turtle,</i>

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:19.060
<i>I feel bad for him.</i>

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:24.450
Being reminded that Guy Sensei 
can use ninjutsu, as well...

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.640
It made me wish I could, too.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.460
Who cares, though?

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.630
Your hand-to-hand combat 
skills are off the charts.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.920
But I...

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.930
I want to become even stronger!

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.250
So... So I can protect Sakura!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.560
Check it out...

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:49.520
I think Sakura's headed 
to the bath house.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.520
Bath house?!

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:05.530
<b>Naruto is Lee, Lee is Naruto!</b>

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.580
Nothing like a nice long 
soak in the big bath...

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.720
Move over, Naruto.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.860
Stop pushing me.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.650
You're hogging it.

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:19.750
I saw it first.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.310
What're you two doing?

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.180
Gulp!

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:27.060
You wouldn't be trying to peep
at Sakura naked, would you?

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.140
O-Of course not!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.970
We're just, um... er, uh...

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.020
Yeah, we were.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.570
There's no excuse.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.530
We were trying to peep.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.440
You're so serious about it!

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.620
I don't go back on my word.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.030
That's my ninja way!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.950
You can try to make it sound smooth,

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.790
but you're still a creep.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.550
I...

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.630
I swear I'll watch over 
Sakura until the day I die!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.050
That shouldn't extend to peeping!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.760
Those were the worst attempts
to be cool I've ever seen!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.700
We're trying to protect 
Sakura from danger!

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.220
We're demonstrating our resolve!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.560
Sh-Shut up!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:18.610
Uh oh...

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.200
I got so ticked off

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.980
I let a Mind-Body Reversal 
Jutsu slip out...

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.390
Don't just let ninjutsu "slip out!"

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.570
That really hurt...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.100
Why am I...

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.700
...standing over there?

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.460
This is one of my clan's 
secret techniques...

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:43.170
It targets two people and 
switches their minds.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.980
Th-Then I'm Naruto...

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.350
And I'm Bushy-Brows?!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.350
This won't do!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.770
Yeah, switch us back!

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.860
I-I'm sorry...

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.710
I can't...

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.030
She looks sick!

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.800
The technique uses a ton of chakra...

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:11.410
I can't switch you back 
till I recover...

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:13.600
Are you okay?

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.280
I don't think so...

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.670
Shoot...

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:20.270
Oh well, I'll just have to use 
the Transformation Jutsu.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.210
That's right...

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.880
Bushy-Brows can't use ninjutsu...

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:29.490
Wait, then maybe...

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:30.890
Transformation Jutsu!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:36.650
I'm back to normal!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.560
Who's that supposed to be?!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.770
You went overboard on 
the pretty-boy factor!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.000
Amazing...

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.480
I did it! My very first ninjutsu!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.380
I can't wait to tell everyone!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:51.190
Hold it!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.330
What was that for?!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.670
How're we gonna explain 
why we're switched?

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.500
Everyone will know we 
were trying to peep...

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:03.920
And...

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.960
You were what?!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:10.220
She'll murder us.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:14.930
We'll just have to keep it under wraps
until Ino recovers her chakra.

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.620
I finally used a ninjutsu... 
This stinks.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.780
It is what it is.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.780
Oh yeah! It's about time to start
 my last training of the day!

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.320
If I don't keep moving, 
my body will lose its edge!

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.320
But... that's my body...

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.190
Speaking of which,

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:39.580
I feel a lot lighter than normal...

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:45.960
Hup!

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:51.350
Wow, I'm so fast!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.840
Well, you're in my body.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.390
Our training methods are 
completely different.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.190
Holy cow!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.720
Martial arts rule!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.320
You've only scratched the surface.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.340
This is the core of 
martial arts training.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.090
Releasing your limiters!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.280
I'm overflowing with power!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:14.410
Here goes!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.830
Eyebrow Whirlwind!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:19.000
Hey, I can use ninjutsu now!

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:20.300
Here goes!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.510
You know...

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.430
Even though you can use chakra
now, you need better style.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:29.280
Then what about this?

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.230
Well?

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.320
This is true youth!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.510
I'm bursting with passion!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.060
That's even worse...

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.180
Oh? I'll show you!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.100
Oh, even though you can't 
turn into yourself!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.690
This should be useful.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.270
Now to use Naruto's 
trademark technique...

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.330
No, that one's out of your league.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.880
Monroe Jutsu!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:57.870
Wow!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.670
I wonder what it'd be like if 
other people got switched.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.710
Like Sakura and Kakashi Sensei...

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.630
It'd probably end up like...

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.610
One Thousand Years of Death!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.840
Why did I have to be the victim?

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.560
If Neji and Sakura were switched...

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:23.590
Attack! Punchline! Cross-dress!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.830
Again, why am I the victim?

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:31.490
Now, if Guy Sensei and 
Sakura were switched...

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.330
Guy Sensei!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.820
Ah, this is youth!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.950
I finally found you, Naruto!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.890
Cut it out.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.910
It's all hypothetical.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:45.390
But I bet if we switched 
with our senseis,

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.600
it'd make for good training.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.000
Maybe so.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.600
Yeah, I bet we could
think of some moves...

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.430
...to try using Kakashi Sensei's 
or Guy Sensei's body.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.770
I'd want to switch with Lady Tsunade!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:00.680
What exactly would you 
want to do in her body?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.880
Just kidding, just kidding.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:06.900
Anyways, let's keep a low profile
until Ino recovers her chakra...

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:13.030
It feels like I'm seeing the 
world in a whole new light.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.550
Yeah, I kinda feel 
stronger than before.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.540
There you are.
 I've been looking for you.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.280
For me?!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.950
<i>Sakura was looking for me...</i>

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.260
<i>Sakura... for me!</i>

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.560
Sakura!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.100
What's with you, Naruto?

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.370
Don't do that creepy act!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.150
Sakura was looking for me!

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:38.420
Excuse me, it's very rude to be
whispering right in front of me.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.970
Sorry about that.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.760
So what's up, anyway?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.760
Are we going on a date or something?

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.970
Sorry...

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:49.920
I, uh... You're just a little 
too intense for me...

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.980
Sorry, friend.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.220
Don't act like you won!

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:59.240
We're switched. You're the 
one she doesn't like!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.310
That's right...

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:06.160
This is fine though, you come, too, Lee.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:11.740
Lady Tsunade's ordered Team Kakashi
and Team Guy on a joint mission.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.790
Hey, Lee, we were just 
about to come find you.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.010
Oh, Tenten and Neji.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.330
Lee's walking like a normal person...

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.470
Well, I guess miracles do happen.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.310
But Lee walking normally...

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:33.980
Bushy-Brows, what kind 
of life do you live?!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.770
I'm the hardest-working ninja there is!

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.200
I do even the most basic things...

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:39.910
Like this, see?

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.660
Knock it off, you'll jam my fingers.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.340
Remember, Lee, we've 
got a mission today.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:47.400
No challenging me to any matches today!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.720
Well duh.

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.630
I already beat you a long time ago.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.920
What's gotten into you?

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.070
You're always pestering 
Neji to fight you!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.210
Huh? O-Oh yeah!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.010
By the way, Neji,

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.500
I heard the Hyugas are 
having a tough time of it.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:04.350
Yeah, well.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.390
Don't worry.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.870
When I become Hokage,

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.830
I'll change the Hyuga Clan for you.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.400
Who are you?!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.820
Everyone's here.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.740
Where's Kakashi Sensei and Guy Sensei?

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.850
Sorry we're late, everyone.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.390
Today, I got lost on the 
road we call "dreams."

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.750
You just took too long.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.020
Actually, Kakashi...

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.900
How about a ramen speed-eating contest?

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.250
Forget it.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.590
I'll just embarrass you 
in front of your pupils.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.510
That's not true!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.090
Guy Sensei will win for sure!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.020
Naruto?

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.760
Because Guy Sensei...

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.670
...is better than everyone!

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:48.890
Th-Thanks...

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.630
<i>My stock seems to have dropped a lot...</i>

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.520
<i>Is it because I was late?</i>

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.000
To think you of all people 
would respect me so much..

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.650
My lost boy, this is real youth!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:01.540
Come, Lee!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.090
Leap into my heaving bosom!

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:05.360
Another bowl, pops!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:07.280
Ramen over me?

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:11.750
Okay, settle down, 
and I'll explain our mission.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:19.720
Hidden in the forest are rogue ninjas
who are targeting the village.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.630
Our mission is to capture them.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.100
I can't believe I have to use 
this body in real combat...

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.540
Bring 'em on!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.560
This is my chance to 
try out real ninjutsu.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.390
I won't lose either.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:40.990
I'll use my techniques 
to protect Sakura!

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:56.330
<b>I Dream of Taking the 
Nine-Tails for a Walk!</b>

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.620
Lee and Naruto remain swapped,

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:03.420
but now Team Guy and Team Kakashi 
are on a joint mission.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:07.580
Neji, your Byakugan made 
things much easier.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.270
We found them right away.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.350
We gotta catch 'em all, right?

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.170
Don't be scared. 
We've got them outnumbered!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.880
You're not going home, Leaf losers!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:19.770
Get 'em!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.700
I'll handle them!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.530
<i>Let's see what Bushy-Brows' 
combat moves can do!</i>

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.040
Eyebrow Whirlwind!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:30.620
He extended his nose hairs?!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.710
You moron, I can counter that easily!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.460
Lee!

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.070
Let's go, Naruto.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.600
I'll draw their attention. 
You cover me!

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.710
Yes, sir!

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.540
<i>Finally, my chance to shine.</i>

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.290
Now, Naruto!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.230
Hit them with a big move!

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.390
Look, Kakashi Sensei!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.450
I made two shadow clones!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.890
So what?

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:59.060
Have no fear, this just 
leads into my new move!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.480
Sexy Sakura Jutsu!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.990
The enemy will all be 
staring at me now!

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:07.950
What are you doing?

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.990
Also, I just said I was in 
charge of distracting them!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.020
But it's perfect!

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.790
This is impressive, even for me!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.380
Although I think I'm 
lacking a few curves...

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.500
Agreed!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.840
Idiots!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.050
What's with you guys?

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.670
Get serious!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:24.710
Okay, Lee!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.940
We'll use a tag team attack!

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.220
O-Okay...

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.350
<i>This time I'll use my newly-evolved 
martial arts prowess!</i>

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.630
Super-Mega Severe Leaf Hurricane!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.060
You expect me to do that?!

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.040
Don't be silly!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.730
Something like that should 
be a breeze for you!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.690
Now rend the air with your kicks
and start shooting some fireballs!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.370
No way man, that's impossible!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.280
Pass!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.040
Huh?

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:52.740
I quit...

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:54.160
You're through!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.580
Kakashi Sensei!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:00.700
Clearly you two aren't at 100% today.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.400
Just stay back!

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:07.190
We're not helping at all...

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.630
If I could just at least 
make some shadow clones...

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:13.270
Forget protecting 
Sakura, at this rate...

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.890
Shall I lend you my power, then?

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.690
<i>That voice...</i>

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:21.520
<i>The beast sealed within Naruto's body?</i>

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.980
So this is the inside of Naruto's mind...

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.900
You there, child.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.520
Let me out of here.

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.950
I can't do that without your 
owner's permission, Niney.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.120
N-Niney?

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.880
I'll give you this if you 
promise to behave yourself.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.340
I have no need for tights!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.490
Fair enough.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:48.840
I have just the thing for you.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.080
A high-quality rubber bone.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.300
I'm not chewing that!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.880
What do you take me for?!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.220
What wild chakra...

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:02.440
I need to speak from the heart
if I'm going to quell his anger...

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:09.040
<i>It's already been six whole months.</i>

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.690
<i>So much time.</i>

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.240
<i>Even he must be...</i>

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.000
<i>But...</i>

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:22.500
Taro...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.000
Taro, you're alive!

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.600
Taro!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.920
Taro!

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:43.690
It appears this mind-swap has 
weakened the seal a bit.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.750
Perhaps now...

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:48.070
Oh no, the seal on the Nine-Tails!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.190
Of all the times...

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.510
Aren't the tails in the wrong spot?

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:57.530
Two of them on the eyebrows...

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.950
<b>Tailed Beast</b>

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.440
He's begun the Tailed...

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:02.180
No, the Browed Beast Transformation!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:05.580
<b>Browed Beast</b>

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.510
I know you're being serious,

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.870
but "browed beast"
 sounds weird, Kakashi Sensei.

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.250
We have to stop him quickly,

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.070
or the browed beast's power 
will run out of control!

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.880
I see we're sticking with 
"browed beast," then.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:16.870
My body's on fire...

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.860
So this is what a giant 
dog's chakra is like...

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.450
Giant dog?!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.090
Guy Sensei!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.850
I have to... control it... for Sensei...

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:31.100
I swear I won't lose control!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.400
Naruto's attacking Guy Sensei!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.030
Now's my chance to seal it!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.010
Seal

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:39.660
Watch out!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.990
The enemy's attacking!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:42.870
Everyone run!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.200
Explosive tags!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:52.900
Oh no!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.550
Sakura fell off the cliff!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:03.550
I'm not hurt too badly, but I can't...

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.350
We've gotta whack...

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.380
...anyone who saw us.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.570
Prepare to die.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:13.220
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.790
<i>I need to heal myself 
with medical ninjutsu,</i>

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:18.000
<i>but there's no time.</i>

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:18.970
What do I do...

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.930
Get her!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.630
Naruto, Lee-san!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:31.000
Huh?

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.960
Ah, the useless guys from earlier.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.150
Guys, don't push it, get the senseis!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.290
It's true that we can't fight normally,

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.790
but we can still beat these guys.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:44.640
But...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.230
Even though I can't use 
ninjutsu, I won't give up.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:52.150
With enough hard work,
I can control Niney's power.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:55.140
I don't go back on my word.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:57.130
That's my ninja way!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.820
Remember, I swore to 
protect you with my life.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.590
Naruto, let's combine our powers!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:06.560
Yeah!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.500
We have to protect Sakura!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.110
We've got this group.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:13.430
Hurry, everyone!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.550
We have to help them!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:25.700
What the...?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:28.350
Here goes!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.480
Rasen Shu-Lee-ken!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.790
He threw him?!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.820
Um...

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:37.240
Shu-Lee-ken...

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:40.280
It feels like they really 
shoehorned that name in...

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.370
Looks like everything worked out.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.130
Yeah.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:47.800
I gotta say, you're something else.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:50.250
It's so hard not being 
able to use ninjutsu,

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.100
but you still manage to fight so well.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.170
And you, Naruto...

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:57.400
Dealing with that giant, 
disobedient dog every day...

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.360
I definitely couldn't handle it.

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:00.510
Giant dog?

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.760
Regardless, we've both got 
a lot on our plates, huh?

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.190
You said it!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.320
Hey, Naruto.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.430
Ah ha, so you two had 
your minds switched.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.860
I knew something was off.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.200
You two have been talking 
like one another all day.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:25.620
Oh... we... uh...

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:30.000
How exactly did this happen?

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.540
Serves you right.

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:41.360
We'll never do it again.
Please switch us back.

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:43.470
P-Pretty please.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.560
Get those swollen faces away from me!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:49.970
Fine, my chakra's fully recovered now.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.810
Here goes... Mind-Body Reverse—

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.350
I'm not just cross-dressing, 
I'm an actual girl now?!

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:05.450
I'm a teenager, not an 
old man in his 30s!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.790
No big deal, right, Guy?

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.360
Youth!

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.160
Uh, Ino, you—

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.650
I'm Sai.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.300
I'm so sorry. When I tripped,

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:18.630
a Mass Mind-Body Reversal Jutsu 
accidentally slipped out...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.160
Not again! You can't let 
ninjutsu just slip out!

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.840
Wait, does that mean...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:27.300
Yeah... until my chakra 
recovers, we're stuck...

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.850
No!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.310
This is all your fault!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.680
What are you gonna do about this?!

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:35.520
Wake up, Ino!

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:39.920
And so, everyone was 
stuck in a different body...

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:43.320
...for a few days until 
Ino's chakra recovered.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.580
Hoo boy...

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:26.510
<b>I'm Sai's New Agent!
Win Lady Tsunade's Heart!</b>

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:24.060
Next week is "I'm Sai's New Agent!"

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:26.510
and "Win Lady Tsunade's Heart!"

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:27.560
Lady Tsunade, huh?

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:30.840
It's finally time! I'm so excited!

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:31.670
About what?

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:33.640
If I'm going to marry Sakura,

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:38.300
my final mission is to win the approval
of her master, Lady Tsunade!

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:43.370
I always figured I'd need to 
find her a boyfriend, too!

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:39.600
Lady Tsunade, I'll be waiting at the gates]

00:23:43.370 --> 00:23:45.610
Lady Tsunade isn't Sakura's mom!

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:48.530
Besides, the two of you 
aren't even dating!
